  "description": "Jeong-Ueom has avoided his arranged marriage for years, but with mounting pressure from the other family, he can no longer delay. Yet, his heart has already been claimed by someone irreplaceable—his younger brother, Dong-Im. Dong-Im is not only Jeong-Yeom’s forbidden love but also the one Jeong-Yeom has kept by his side, no matter the cost. In the biting chill of winter, longing for a spring that may never come, Jeong-Yeom finds himself once again drawn to Dong-Im’s room.\n\n*“Dear brother, how does it feel? How does it feel to marry my woman?”*\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's SS Short Story Collection (SS 단편선) or the Depraved Collection in english.*",
